      "id": "claim_530059dee05e4c1f8a0650e5832f4a89",
      "statement": "In MDL-CR-007 the scenario PD is base annual PD × (1 + PD elasticity × (scenario peak unemployment − baseline unemployment) × 100), floored at 0, and the lifetime PD is 1 − (1 − scenario PD)^remaining life in years; lifetime PD then feeds lifetime ECL = EAD × lifetime PD × scenario LGD in ECL_Calc.",
